      "writtenOn": "2017-12-11T19:39:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, I believe all the functions that use \"mCi\" should be \"Slot\" thing, not card thing, not profile thing. But for backward compatibility, we do need to keep those \"public\" functions in UiccCard, right?  So how about keep those functions unchanged (I can modify the code so that those requests won\u0027t be delegated to profile)?",
