      "writtenOn": "2017-12-13T23:53:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually they should be a profile thing, not slot thing. It\u0027s just for now there is only one active profile assumed to be in the slot, so it can be a slot thing. Later when there are multiple active profiles in a slot, mCi will be an array in slot, if slot maintains it at all. I agree it is possible that there is no active profile, but in that case there should be no mCi associated with it. Ideally we need a separate hal for slot in that case.",
